{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face great foes in a decision and reaction\u2011based ARPG with intense hack\u2011and\u2011slash combat, where every successful strike is rewarding and every misstep is costly. Katavader\u2019s swordplay challenges you to master timing, precision, and calculated decisions. Explore the realm to uncover long\u2011lost secrets and elevate your combat flow with hidden collectibles and upgrades.  Ascend toward Apotheosis! Will you aid the realm, or invade it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Intense Hack-and-Slash combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver fast, impactful blows that land with real weight, chaining into smooth, controlled combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/4fcb25a1a536bdce7118df16658752b7.poster.avif?t=1774522345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/4fcb25a1a536bdce7118df16658752b7.webm?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/4fcb25a1a536bdce7118df16658752b7.mp4?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Read, React and Punish!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duel great foes with formidable weapon arts: some attacks can\u2019t be blocked, some can\u2019t be evaded, and some severely exhaust your stamina. Read the patterns, react, or land a perfect parry to stagger them and unleash  counterstrikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/911e8cc700ad39f0ce8a01a9763699dc.poster.avif?t=1774522345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/911e8cc700ad39f0ce8a01a9763699dc.webm?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/911e8cc700ad39f0ce8a01a9763699dc.mp4?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Explore the Lost Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the realm, platform to reach distant heights, and uncover secrets. Collect stat manuals to enhance your build, find rare healing beans for clutch recoveries, and integrate IR (Interactive Response) abilities for powerful dueling advantages. Discover long\u2011lost shrines where you can rest, enhance stats, customize your katana\u2019s look and choose your active IR (Interactive Response) ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/1693ac2ed176a547762f36cf26b4cc19.poster.avif?t=1774522345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/1693ac2ed176a547762f36cf26b4cc19.webm?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/1693ac2ed176a547762f36cf26b4cc19.mp4?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense hack-and-slash combat with ARPG elements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision and reaction-based duels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, platform and discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find long-lost collectibles and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive build system with varied combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Genesis to Apotheosis - will you aid the realm or invade it?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999010?t=1774522345","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/efcb51a06d2b8cbfab6b02857a49e1f9e0189360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774522345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/87e87725aff7dfb30df590f8416c2e38058a0422/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774522345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/87e87725aff7dfb30df590f8416c2e38058a0422/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774522345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face great foes in a decision and reaction\u2011based ARPG with intense hack\u2011and\u2011slash combat, where every successful strike is rewarding and every misstep is costly. Katavader\u2019s swordplay challenges you to master timing, precision, and calculated decisions. Explore the realm to uncover long\u2011lost secrets and elevate your combat flow with hidden collectibles and upgrades.  Ascend toward Apotheosis! Will you aid the realm, or invade it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Intense Hack-and-Slash combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver fast, impactful blows that land with real weight, chaining into smooth, controlled combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span