ver long\u2011lost shrines where you can rest, enhance stats, customize your katana\u2019s look and choose your active IR (Interactive Response) ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/1693ac2ed176a547762f36cf26b4cc19.poster.avif?t=1774522345\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/1693ac2ed176a547762f36cf26b4cc19.webm?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/extras/1693ac2ed176a547762f36cf26b4cc19.mp4?t=1774522345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense hack-and-slash combat with ARPG elements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decision and reaction-based duels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, platform and discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find long-lost collectibles and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive build system with varied combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Genesis to Apotheosis - will you aid the realm or invade it?</p></li></ul>","developers":["Siddhant Rathor"],"dlc":[4009260],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999010/8f904830a5057c83f274241b4e9684d662f49350/header.jpg?t=1774522345","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3999010/1929255723/e6a92bfd5de257d3ed47180c6358060429d015bd/1774384970/d